# Project-local semgrepignore.
#
# Semgrep's built-in default template (--semgrepignore-defaults) excludes
# `tests/`, which would suppress our LexicalNoiseJava fixtures. The presence
# of this file makes Semgrep use *this* list instead of the default,
# allowing tests/fixtures/lexical_noise_v1/ to be scanned by the SemGrep
# comparative baseline.
#
# We still want to keep large/irrelevant trees out of Semgrep scans.

.git/
.venv/
node_modules/
outputs/
__pycache__/
frontend/build/
frontend/.next/
frontend/dist/
playwright-screenshots/
*.min.js
*.min.css
